  "text": "This person's asking what things that they can study or look into to become better because influencers are just making stuff up, which I totally agree with. Yes, a couple books. The book, The Logic of Sports Betting by Ed Miller and Matthew Davidow. Read that first. Quite frankly, read it, read it again, read it again, read it again. That is a great way. That's going to take you from 101 to honestly 301. It's going to give you a good high impact improvement on how everything works. That will then also, I think, open up the doors for you to understand, okay, well, there's this way to make money, which is kind of the top down way, which is the less analytically intense way. And then there's the bottom up, which is like build your own models and do that. But you'll understand both of those approaches. And then from there, you'll start to look into those things. And then I would move over to unabated and look into a lot of their stuff. I hope this helps.",
